// Disc Menu: a built-in Lumtub skin. skins/template/skin.jsonc explains every
// field, and skins/README.md how to make your own.
// 光碟菜单：Lumtub 内置皮肤。每个字段的说明见 skins/template/skin.jsonc，自己做皮肤见 skins/README.md。
{
  "lumtubSkin": 1,
  "id": "disc",
